NAME: prometheus
LAST DEPLOYED: Sun Nov  1 19:06:15 2026
NAMESPACE: crane-system
STATUS: deployed
REVISION: 1
TEST SUITE: None
NOTES:
The Prometheus server can be accessed via port 8080 on the following DNS name from within your cluster:
prometheus-server.crane-system.svc.cluster.local


Get the Prometheus server URL by running these commands in the same shell:
  export POD_NAME=$(kubectl get pods --namespace crane-system -l "app.kubernetes.io/name=prometheus,app.kubernetes.io/instance=prometheus" -o jsonpath="{.items[0].metadata.name}")
  kubectl --namespace crane-system port-forward $POD_NAME 9090
